    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳推哪個屬性的寶可夢？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B363A854EA500B5C6C602776845BF653EF5922FF1F00100002011401290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的話絕對是妖精屬性！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621176848A717D555C0D662F59967CBE5C6C6027FF0100100002011401290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的服裝是由\n有名的妖精屬性訓練家設計的！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62117684670D88DD662F7531000A6709540D768459967CBE5C6C60278A137DF45BB68A2D8A087684FF0100100002011401290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "與她眼光一致的我\n理所當然也是推妖精屬性！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "82075979773C51494E0081F476846211000A74066240757671364E5F662F63A859967CBE5C6C6027FF0100100002011401290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "對了！<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳和我推的屬性\n在對戰中是哪邊比較強呢？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C0D4E86FF0100100003110000FF01014F6059B3548C621163A876845C6C6027000A57285C0D62304E2D662F54EA908A6BD48F035F375462FF1F00100002011401290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果想比比看誰推的屬性比較強，\n就請<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳和我搭話吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C60F36BD46BD4770B8AB063A876845C6C60276BD48F035F37FF0C000A5C318ACB00100003110000FF01014F6059B3548C6211642D8A715427300200100002011401290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我推妖精屬性！\n和我推的寶可夢們對戰吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621163A859967CBE5C6C6027FF01000A548C621163A876845BF653EF592250115C0D62305427FF0100100002011401290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "對戰吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C0D62305427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我準備一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62116E9650994E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "記得用<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳推的屬性好好準備喔。\n當然有很多種屬性也沒問題就是了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8A185F97752800100003110000FF01014F6059B363A876845C6C6027597D597D6E96509955943002000A7576713667095F88591A7A2E5C6C60274E5F6C92554F984C5C31662F4E86FF0100100002011401290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那我們就趕快開始吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A3621150115C318D955FEB958B59CB5427FF0100100002011401290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "對妖精屬性來說，\n某個屬性的攻擊是沒有效果的喔。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳知道嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C0D59967CBE5C6C60274F868AAAFF0C000A67D0500B5C6C60277684653B64CA662F6C9267096548679C76845594300200100001BE00000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B377E5905355CEFF1F00100002011401290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "唉……真可惜。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "550920262026771F53EF60DC300200100002011401290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "妖精屬性的寶可夢\n會讓龍屬性的攻擊完全沒有效果。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n雖然牠們都是厲害的孩子……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "59967CBE5C6C602776845BF653EF5922000A67038B939F8D5C6C60277684653B64CA5B8C51686C9267096548679C300200100001BE00000A96D671367260501190FD662F53B25BB376845B695B502026202600100002011401290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "……不過妖精屬性當然也有\n不擅長應付的屬性就是了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "202620264E0D904E59967CBE5C6C6027757671364E5F6709000A4E0D64C5957761C94ED876845C6C60275C31662F4E86300200100002011401290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果選擇的寶可夢都是相同屬性，\n不擅長應付的屬性也會變得固定。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C907864C776845BF653EF592290FD662F76F8540C5C6C6027FF0C000A4E0D64C5957761C94ED876845C6C60274E5F67038B8A5F9756FA5B9A300200100002011401290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "即使如此我還是會繼續推牠們！\n所謂有推的屬性就是這麼一回事！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53734F7F59826B6462119084662F67037E7C7E8C63A872605011FF01000A62408B02670963A876845C6C60275C31662F90199EBC4E0056DE4E8BFF0100100002011401290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "即使不擅長應付的屬性會變得固定也繼續推！\n所謂有推的屬性就是這麼一回事！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
